{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13311120","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13311120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1331112001:1":{"text":"我这次想要制造的是雪人机！那种可以自动堆雪人的机器……","source_cn":"我这次想要制造的是雪人机！那种可以自动堆雪人的机器……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9CD1A4730358F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1331112002:1":{"text":"你是觉得雪松镇的人都不会堆雪人吗？","source_cn":"你是觉得雪松镇的人都不会堆雪人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD04077B9A82CBA8B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1331112003:1":{"text":"我知道大家都会堆雪人，但是他们只会堆普通的雪人，那也太没有区分度了！所以我希望这个机器可以堆出不同外貌的雪人……怎么样！","source_cn":"我知道大家都会堆雪人，但是他们只会堆普通的雪人，那也太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30590AA84B083BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1331112004:1":{"text":"真是……令人眼前一黑的想法。","source_cn":"真是……令人眼前一黑的想法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9820386D7F10C354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人特莱姆":{"text":"商人特莱姆","source":"商人特莱姆","status":"source"},"speaker:矮人工匠司都恩":{"text":"矮人工匠司都恩","source":"矮人工匠司都恩","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}